      'Rash / facial swelling / breathing or swallowing difficulty (severe allergic/anaphylactoid reaction) - stop immediately, urgent care',
      'REDs / low energy availability presentation in athletes - menstrual disturbance in active women is disproportionately driven by low energy availability (functional hypothalamic amenorrhoea), NOT prolactin. Chasteberry offers no mechanism to correct this. Screen energy availability, training load, disordered eating FIRST. Refer sports physician + APD',
