      'Bulk root powder, unbranded capsules, "black cohosh 500 mg" products, multi-herb menopause blends - documented species-adulteration risk (Health Canada retrieved samples from four suspected hepatotoxicity cases, NONE contained authentic A. racemosa); first-reported liver failure case was in a compounded liquid. Do NOT recommend',
