      'Pure endurance athletes - inconsistent evidence, no benefit demonstrated (Viribay 2022, Harnden 2023, 2025 controlled trial null on time-to-exhaustion)',
      'Strength/1RM specialists - creatine wins unambiguously; Wang 2026 strength/power subgroup g=0.10 p=0.28 (not significant)',
      'Body-composition-driven clients - 21-RCT dose-response meta null on BMI, weight, fat mass, waist, body-fat %, fat-free mass',
      'General perimenopausal BR cohort as default - female evidence is UNMEASURED not smaller (only 3 of 30 trials female-only in Wang 2026, cycle-phase control varied). Say honestly rather than implying it does not work in women',
