      'L-arginine co-supplementation - pointless, citrulline IS the arginine delivery vehicle',
      'Client presenting the "pump" as evidence of performance benefit - vasodilation sensation has no consistent relationship to work output',
      'Chronic dosing chased instead of periodised acute use - Wang 2026 chronic supplementation did NOT reach significance (g=0.13 p=0.09); evidence is more stable for acute pre-session dosing',
      'Continued use without an n-of-1 responder trial - population-level effect is small and fragile; give it 4-6 sessions with defined stop rule',
