      'Antibacterial mouthwash use during protocol (chlorhexidine, cetylpyridinium chloride, alcohol-based rinses) - ABOLISHES the effect via kill of oral commensal bacteria that perform the nitrate-nitrite reduction. Stop for duration of protocol not just morning of. Fluoride toothpaste is fine, mechanical cleaning is fine',
